WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.868
-Welcome back, everybody.
Ariana Grande is joining us!

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:06.067
Ah!

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.567
We talked about so many things.

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:08.801
You have the secret thing
coming out.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:10.667
That's all good stuff.
-The secret thing, man.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.067
-I know, I know. I want to
talk about "The Voice."

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:15.300
Live shows start next week.
-Yes.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:16.968
-This is your first season
on the --

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.901
Are you enjoying it so far?

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:20.901
-I'm loving it so much.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.367
I love everybody on set.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:24.434
I love the coaches.
I love my contestants.

00:00:24.434 --> 00:00:25.834
They are so talented.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.467
I believe in them so much.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:31.234
Like, I know this is just
a starting point for everybody,

00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:35.000
and knowing that, of course,
we want them to win, of course,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.267
but just the fact that this is
here and the world gets to

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:40.701
fall in love with them and to be
a part of it is so special,

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.968
I -- I'm so thankful to be
a part of it and --

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:45.167
-You're such a good coach.
-It alleviates -- Thank you.

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:46.734
It just alleviates so much
pressure knowing that

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:49.234
this is already happening and
it's going to happen for them.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.934
You know?
I'm sorry, I'm just so excited.

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:53.234
I'm their stage mother.
I'm their stage mother.

00:00:53.234 --> 00:00:56.300
-I will say, I mean, this is
one of the best seasons.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.000
You guys got to check it out.
It's really a great season.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.100
I'm not just saying that.
But when we were doing

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.901
our secret project thing,
you were going into --

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:04.901
-[ Laughs ]
-I don't know what to call it.

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.667
I keep talking about the secret.

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:11.200
But you kept going -- when you
were getting hair and makeup,

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.200
you were watching "The Voice."
-I know!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.300
-Because you were that invested
and you were like,

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.834
"Dude, I have to --
These are my babies, man.

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.033
I've got to root for
these guys."

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:21.133
And I was like,
"Dude, you really love it."

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.100
-We're in a group chat,
and when it's happening live,

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.000
they're all talking about what's
happening and how excited

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.133
they are for one another, and
it's so sweet and so supportive,

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.834
and I'm like, "I have to be
involved in this.

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:33.200
I want to watch."
And so I watch.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:37.467
-Good chemistry though, you
and Kelly and Blake and John,

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:40.901
you guys -- we all hung out
together for "That's My Jam,"

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:43.534
but you all got along with
each other, like, so well.

00:01:43.534 --> 00:01:45.400
You and Blake are
a team on our show,

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.334
and I love that combo of --
-Oh, we sure are.

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:51.133
-Yeah. Because it's Blake
and you, and it's just so cute.

00:01:51.133 --> 00:01:52.567
[ Laughter ]
It's just perfect.

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:55.067
You've done collaborations
with Kelly.

00:01:55.067 --> 00:01:57.167
You've done with John.

00:01:57.167 --> 00:02:00.467
Can we see maybe an Ariana/
Blake Shelton collaboration?

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.267
-I mean, I would --
Personally, I would love that.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:06.801
I'm a little bit surprised that
he hasn't reached out yet.

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:11.234
Sorry, for me to be on the remix

00:02:11.234 --> 00:02:13.534
of his most recent single
titled,

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:15.534
"When I Die, I Hope I Come Back
as a Country Boy."

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.667
I personally feel
that I'm a perfect fit

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:19.667
for something like that.
-Yeah, absolutely, yeah.

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:22.067
That is actually a great idea.
I'll put a call in to his agent.

00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:23.033
Yeah, we'll talk.
We'll figure it out.

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:24.200
-Thank you.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.701
-I want to show everyone --
-Let me know.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:28.534
-I want to show everyone a clip
of Ariana Grande on "The Voice."

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:29.701
Take a look at this.

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:33.133
-I am drained emotionally.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:36.834
Those performances were
so next-level incredible.

00:02:36.834 --> 00:02:40.601
Jershika, your ability to make
everyone in the room feel

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:43.167
what you are feeling
at the same time is special.

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:44.467
-Thank you!

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:47.133
-Paris, I started welling up
while you were singing

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:50.634
'cause your ability to storytell
and move everybody.

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:53.267
I have no idea what I would do
here at all.

00:02:53.267 --> 00:02:55.200
Can we change the rules
of the show just this once?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.133
[ Laughter ]
You've got a pull.

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:59.133
-This is my show.
-Come on!

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:00.968
-[ Laughs ]
"This is my show."

00:03:00.968 --> 00:03:03.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.901
Do you get emotional when
contestants have to leave?

00:03:06.901 --> 00:03:08.701
-I do.

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:11.167
You really form a relationship
with them

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.367
when you're working with them
and just over the course

00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:15.767
of the show and I --
They're so talented

00:03:15.767 --> 00:03:17.033
and I really believe in
them all.

00:03:17.033 --> 00:03:19.334
And like I said before,
the thing that alleviates

00:03:19.334 --> 00:03:21.667
any sort of stress or pressure
is the fact that

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:25.501
they have already had this
amazing platform and opportunity

00:03:25.501 --> 00:03:27.400
for people to see them
and fall in love with them,

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:31.200
and I know they're all going to
have such amazing music careers

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.000
and I'm so excited to see
what happens for them.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.834
-All these people, yeah,
when you see them,

00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:38.501
and vote for them and make
Ariana win, please.

00:03:38.501 --> 00:03:39.801
We want --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:39.801 --> 00:03:41.901
-Make them win. It's them.
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:41.901 --> 00:03:43.934
-It's them. They win.
Yeah, I know.

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:46.000
Let's see. We talked about
that, secret thing.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.801
We talked about this,
"The Voice."

00:03:48.801 --> 00:03:51.334
-I feel like an agent.
Look at my little headphones.

00:03:51.334 --> 00:03:52.934
I feel like a Hollywood agent.

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:55.701
-Could you get me a part,
yeah, on Nickelodeon?

00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:57.968
-I'm like, "Jimmy, you got
the call back."

00:03:57.968 --> 00:04:00.434
[ Laughter ]
"They loved ya."

00:04:00.434 --> 00:04:02.868
-"They loved ya.
You're a little green."

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:06.033
Let's see. Did I miss --
Did we miss anything?

00:04:06.033 --> 00:04:07.834
-I don't know, man.

00:04:07.834 --> 00:04:11.634
-Oh, what's going on --
-Oh! Yes.

00:04:11.634 --> 00:04:14.534
I have a makeup line that is
dropping on Friday, next Friday.

00:04:14.534 --> 00:04:15.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
That is exciting.

00:04:15.801 --> 00:04:18.234
-You're doing everything!
You're unbelievable!

00:04:18.234 --> 00:04:20.000
Wait, you have
a whole makeup line?

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.100
-Yes, but it pales in comparison

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.200
to your skin-care routine
that I saw.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.434
[ Laughter ]
I love you, I'm sorry.

00:04:25.434 --> 00:04:27.534
I'll drop it. I'll drop it.
It's a joke.

00:04:27.534 --> 00:04:29.667
It's part of the secret thing.

00:04:29.667 --> 00:04:31.834
-Oh, my gosh, that was
so embarrassing.

00:04:31.834 --> 00:04:34.033
But yours is real.

00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:37.267
You have a real skin care --
beauty stuff coming out.

00:04:37.267 --> 00:04:39.734
-Yes. It's happening.
-Yeah.

00:04:39.734 --> 00:04:41.334
[ Laughter ]
-Who doesn't?

00:04:41.334 --> 00:04:43.133
No, I'm kidding.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:46.334
-But it's always a pleasure
talking to you.

00:04:46.334 --> 00:04:49.033
I'm going to text you after this
just to tell you

00:04:49.033 --> 00:04:51.634
how much I love you.
-Please. I love you so much.

00:04:51.634 --> 00:04:54.067
This was so much fun,
and I miss being there in person

00:04:54.067 --> 00:04:56.234
and I miss New York. I love you.
-I had so much fun with you that

00:04:56.234 --> 00:04:58.901
I can't even talk about
how much fun Ariana Grande is.

00:04:58.901 --> 00:05:01.133
The most fun, coolest
human being on Earth.

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.033
-I love you.
-I love you.

00:05:03.033 --> 00:05:04.667
Ariana Grande, everyone!
-I love you!

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:08.968
-"The Voice" airs Mondays and
Tuesdays at 8:00 p.m. on NBC.

